                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}(x+y)^2&=x^2+2xy+y^2\\\\(x+y)^2&=9^2=81\\\\x^2+y^2&=81-2(5)\\\\x^2+y^2&=81-10=71\\end{aligned}",
